    "convergence": "N10 full-40ps xAl0.20 rises by 12.29%; xAl0.45 and xAl0.80 change less than 0.4%. Errors decrease but remain above 3%.",
    "xAl_0.20_40ps": "Selected cutoff around 1.6 THz; cost and cutoff criterion pass, with a broad low-frequency eta plateau.",
    "xAl_0.45_40ps": "Selected cutoff around 1.6 THz; cost and cutoff criterion pass, with a broad low-frequency eta plateau.",
    "xAl_0.80_40ps": "Selected cutoff moves from about 2.4 to 1.9 THz. Eta remains near 1.81. Criterion z increases from 1.10844 to 2.20498 and fails.",
    "xAl_0.80_first20ps": "Main cutoff peak shifts lower; N10 also has a secondary peak around 4 THz. Eta remains near 1.76; criterion z increases from 0.44645 to 2.02540 and narrowly fails.",
    "xAl_0.80_second20ps": "The pathological N5 concentration near 9 THz is absent at N10; the main weight is now near 2.5 THz with a lower-frequency shoulder. Model uncertainty is much better behaved. Eta rises from 1.41871 to 1.78648. Criterion z improves from 11.09596 to 2.44914 but still fails. This does not establish physical drift."
